  - issues: [{file, line, severity, impact_ms, message, fix}]
  - summary: {total_issues, critical_count, high_count, medium_count, low_count, estimated_total_impact_ms}

  Check for: O(n^2+) nested loops, blocking I/O in async code, memory leaks,
  redundant computation, missing caching, large allocations in hot paths,
  inefficient data structures, N+1 queries, unbounded memory.

  ```json
  {
    "issues": [{"file": "input", "line": 1, "severity": "high", "impact_ms": 500, "message": "...", "fix": "..."}],
    "summary": {"total_issues": 0, "estimated_total_impact_ms": 0}
