# 🏆 FINAL REPORT — Code-Reviewer Multi-Agent System (5 Cycles)

## Executive Summary

The **code-reviewer** multi-agent system was built, optimized, and tested across **5 independent cycles**. Each cycle = fresh `/tmp/code-reviewer` → 6 YAML agent files → Dashboard → Live test → Optimize → 3 real code reviews.

