## Architecture (Consistent Across All Cycles)

```
code input
    |
    v
code-reviewer (orchestrator)
    |
    +-- PARALLEL dispatch (async delegates) ----------+
    |                                                   |
    +-> style-reviewer     (lint, formatting, naming)   |
    +-> security-reviewer  (vulns, CWE, mandatory gate) |
    +-> perf-reviewer      (O(n²), caching, I/O)       |
    +-> test-reviewer      (coverage, edge cases)      |
    |                                                   |
    +-- ALL 4 complete (collect) ----------------------+
    |
    v
review-aggregator (score 0-100 + decision)
    |
    v
final report (prioritized issues)
```

**Parallel groups**: `reviewers` (4 agents, no deps) → depends_on → `aggregation` (1 agent)

